OL,3,AUber shuts operations in Nigeria and
OL,4,AUganda with immediate effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FUber has announced it is closing its
OL,7,Foperations in Nigeria - Africa's most
OL,8,Fpopulous country - and the East African
OL,9,Fnation of Uganda with immediate effect
OL,11,FThe global ride-hailing giant said it
OL,12,Fhad come to the "difficult decision"
OL,13,Fafter a thorough review of its
OL,14,Fbusiness. It began operating in Nigeria
OL,15,Fin 2014 and in Uganda two years later.
OL,17,FUber taxi drivers in Nigeria have long
OL,18,Fcomplained that prices on the app are
OL,19,Ftoo low, given the rising cost of fuel,
OL,20,Fand that commission charges are too
OL,21,Fhigh. The company has also faced
OL,22,Fpressure from rival platforms.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
