OL,3,AUber shuts operations in Nigeria and
OL,4,AUganda with immediate effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement came as Uber's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, Dara Khosrowshahi, said the
OL,8,Fcompany was cutting its global
OL,9,Fworkforce by 10%.
